window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.rowsHtml+="<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1137\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδακρυτί</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Advérbio: sem lágrimas, sem choro ou derramamento de lágrimas; Isócrates, Fílon, Plutarco.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1138\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδάκρυτος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον. I. Ativamente, que não chora, sem lágrimas, impassível; inclusive olhos anormalmente secos em medicina. II. Com genitivo, que não chora por alguém. III. Passivam</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1139\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδακτῶ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa ἀδακτῶ = κνήθομαι, «coço-me, sinto prurido»; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1140\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδαλές</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa ἀδαλές = ὑγιές, «saudável, são»; Hesíquio; a etimologia proposta depende da forma dórica.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1141\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδαμάντινος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -η, -ον. I. De adamante, feito de aço ou metal duríssimo; Píndaro, Ésquilo, Ésquines. II. Figuradamente duro como adamante, inflexível, implacável, insensível; Platão</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1142\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδαμαντόδετος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: preso ou atado com ferro duríssimo, com laços de adamante; Ésquilo, Prometeu.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1143\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδαμαντοπέδιλος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: assente sobre base de adamante, com sustentação incorruptível; de colunas, Píndaro.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1144\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδάμας</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino, genitivo -αντος. I. Adamante: substância duríssima, geralmente metal especialmente resistente, talvez aço; Hesíodo. Metaforicamente firmeza inabalável, </td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1145\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδαμαστί</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Advérbio: invencivelmente, sem ser dominado; Suda.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1146\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδάμαστος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: não subjugado, indomável, inflexível; de Hades em Homero; de potro não adestrado em Xenofonte.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1147\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδάματος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: não vencido, indomado, selvagem; de jovem ainda não casada, virgem; de novilho; Ésquilo, Sófocles, Eurípides. Uso especialmente lírico na tragédia.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1147a\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδαμάτωρ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: epíteto ritual de Hécate, ἀδαμάτωρ; Papiro Mágico de Paris 1.2717, sem etimologia segura na entrada.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1148\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδαμνεῖς</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa ἀδαμνεῖς = ἀκολασταίνεις, «comportas-te licenciosamente, sem disciplina»; Hesíquio; variantes manuscritas.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1149\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδαμνής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ές e variante ἄδαμνος: equivalente a ἀδάμαστος, não dominado ou indomável; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1150\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδαμος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: equivalente a ἀδάμαστος, invencível ou indomado; poesia lírica jônica.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1151\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδαν</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma eólica de ἄδην, «à saciedade, em abundância»; Álcman 76.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1152\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδάνειστος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: não oferecido como garantia por outro empréstimo, livre de caução de dívida; papiro BGU 741.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1153\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδαξάω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo ἀδαξάω ou ἀδαξέω, com infinitivo ἀδαξῆσαι e forma ἀδάξομαι: remissão ao verbete ὀδάξω; não atribuir nova acepção sem cotejo.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1154\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδάπανος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον. I. Sem despesa, gratuito, que nada custa; Aristófanes, Díodoro. Advérbio ἀδαπάνως, sem gastos. II. De pessoas, que não gasta ou não emprega dinheiro, com genitiv</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1155\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδαπτον</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa ἄδαπτον = γυμνόν, ἄδερμον, «nu, sem pele, despido»; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1156\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδάρκη</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino ἀδάρκη, também masculino ἀδάρκης e ἄδαρκος: eflorescência salina depositada sobre plantas de pântanos; Dioscórides, Galeno. Diminutivo ἀδάρκιον.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1157\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδαρτος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: sem ter a pele retirada, não esfolado; por extensão não espancado, não açoitado; Hesíquio, glossários.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1158\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδασμος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: isento de tributo, livre de imposto; Ésquilo, fragmento 63.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1159\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδαστος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: não dividido, não repartido ou distribuído; Sófocles, Ájax 54; variante ἄδατος em Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1160\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδαυῶς</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Advérbio ἀδαυῶς = ἐγρηγόρως, «em vigília, estando desperto»; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>";
window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.cardsHtml+="<article id=\"entry-lsj-n1137\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1137\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1151\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδακρυτί\" data-meanings=\"Advérbio: sem lágrimas, sem choro ou derramamento de lágrimas; Isócrates, Fílon, Plutarco.\">ἀδακρυτί</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Advérbio: sem lágrimas, sem choro ou derramamento de lágrimas; Isócrates, Fílon, Plutarco.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dakru_ti/&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1137&quot; key=&quot;a)dakru_ti/&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδακρ-ῡτί&quot;&gt;ἀδακρυτί&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;sense id=&quot;n1137.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;tearlessly, without tears,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0010,012:47&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Isoc.&lt;/author&gt; 14.47&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Ph.&lt;/author&gt;  &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0018,001:2:67&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;2.67&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,048:7&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Caes.&lt;/title&gt; 7&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1138\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1138\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1152\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδάκρυτος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον. I. Ativamente, que não chora, sem lágrimas, impassível; inclusive olhos anormalmente secos em medicina. II. Com genitivo, que \">ἀδάκρυτος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον. I. Ativamente, que não chora, sem lágrimas, impassível; inclusive olhos anormalmente secos em medicina. II. Com genitivo, que não chora por alguém. III. Passivamente, não chorado, não pranteado. IV. Que não custa lágrimas ou luto, de vitória ou troféus; Homero, Sófocles, Plutarco.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)da/kru_tos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1138&quot; key=&quot;a)da/kru_tos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδάκρ-ῡτος&quot;&gt;ἀδάκρυτος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1138.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;without tears&lt;/i&gt;: &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;I&quot; id=&quot;n1138.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Act.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;i&gt;tearless,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. καὶ ἀπήμων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:1:415&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 1.415&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:24:61&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 24.61&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδακρύτω ἔχεν ὄσσε&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:4:186&quot;&gt;4.186&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀστένακτος κἀ&lt;/foreign&gt;. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,001:1200&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 1200&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εὐνάζειν ἀ. βλεφάρων πόθον&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;so that they weep not,&lt;/i&gt; ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,001:106&quot;&gt;106&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.):—Medic., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ὀφθαλμός&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;abnormally dry,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0718,007:7:91&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Aet.&lt;/author&gt; 7.91&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1138.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; c. gen., &lt;i&gt;not weeping for,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τινός&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;Epigr.Gr.&lt;/title&gt; 241a13&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1138.3&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;i&gt;unwept,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,002:881&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ant.&lt;/title&gt; 881&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1138.4&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;costing no tears,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τρόπαια&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,018:37&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tim.&lt;/title&gt; 37&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1139\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1139\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1153\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδακτῶ\" data-meanings=\"Glosa ἀδακτῶ = κνήθομαι, «coço-me, sinto prurido»; Hesíquio.\">ἀδακτῶ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Glosa ἀδακτῶ = κνήθομαι, «coço-me, sinto prurido»; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)daktw=&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1139&quot; key=&quot;a)daktw=&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδακτῶ·&quot;&gt;ἀδακτῶ&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κνήθομαι,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1140\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1140\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1154\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδαλές\" data-meanings=\"Glosa ἀδαλές = ὑγιές, «saudável, são»; Hesíquio; a etimologia proposta depende da forma dórica.\">ἀδαλές</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Glosa ἀδαλές = ὑγιές, «saudável, são»; Hesíquio; a etimologia proposta depende da forma dórica.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dale/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1140&quot; key=&quot;a)dale/s&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδαλές·&quot;&gt;ἀδαλές&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὑγιές,,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt; [&lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ᾱ&lt;/itype&gt;, if from &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δαλέομαι,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Dor.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; for &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δηλ-.&lt;/foreign&gt;]&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1141\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1141\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1155\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδαμάντινος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -η, -ον. I. De adamante, feito de aço ou metal duríssimo; Píndaro, Ésquilo, Ésquines. II. Figuradamente duro como adamante, inflexí\">ἀδαμάντινος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -η, -ον. I. De adamante, feito de aço ou metal duríssimo; Píndaro, Ésquilo, Ésquines. II. Figuradamente duro como adamante, inflexível, implacável, insensível; Platão, Teócrito. Advérbio ἀδαμαντίνως, de modo inflexível.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dama/nti^nos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1141&quot; key=&quot;a)dama/nti^nos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδαμάντῐνος&quot;&gt;ἀδαμάντινος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;η&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1141.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;adamantine, of steel,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:4:224&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 4.224&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,003:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 6&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,003:64&quot;&gt;64&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0026,003:84&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Aeschin.&lt;/author&gt; 3.84&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. κερκίδες,&lt;/foreign&gt; of the &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Μοῖραι,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lyr.Adesp.&lt;/title&gt; ap. &lt;author&gt;Stob.&lt;/author&gt; 1.5.11; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;αἱμασιή&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Eus.Mynd.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 63&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1141.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; metaph., &lt;i&gt;hard as adamant,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οὐδεὶς ἂν γένοιτο . . οὕτως ἀ., ὃς ἂν . . &lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:360b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 360b&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;σιδηροῖς καὶ ἀ. λόγοις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,023:509a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Grg.&lt;/title&gt; 509a&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δεσμοί&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Metrod.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Herc.&lt;/title&gt; 831.12&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οὐκ ἀ. ἐστίν,&lt;/foreign&gt; of a girl, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0005,001:3:39&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Theoc.&lt;/author&gt; 3.39&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-νως&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:618e&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 618e&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1142\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1142\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1156\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδαμαντόδετος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: preso ou atado com ferro duríssimo, com laços de adamante; Ésquilo, Prometeu.\">ἀδαμαντόδετος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: preso ou atado com ferro duríssimo, com laços de adamante; Ésquilo, Prometeu.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)da^manto/detos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1142&quot; key=&quot;a)da^manto/detos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδᾰμαντό-δετος&quot;&gt;ἀδαμαντόδετος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1142.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;iron-bound,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;λῦμαι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,003:148&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 148&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,003:426&quot;&gt;426&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1143\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1143\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1157\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδαμαντοπέδιλος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: assente sobre base de adamante, com sustentação incorruptível; de colunas, Píndaro.\">ἀδαμαντοπέδιλος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: assente sobre base de adamante, com sustentação incorruptível; de colunas, Píndaro.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)da^mantope/dilos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1143&quot; key=&quot;a)da^mantope/dilos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδᾰμαντο-πέδι-λος&quot;&gt;ἀδαμαντοπέδιλος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1143.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;on a base of adamant,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κίονες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,005:88:5&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 88.5&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1144\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1144\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1158\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδάμας\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino, genitivo -αντος. I. Adamante: substância duríssima, geralmente metal especialmente resistente, talvez aço; Hesíodo. M\">ἀδάμας</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino, genitivo -αντος. I. Adamante: substância duríssima, geralmente metal especialmente resistente, talvez aço; Hesíodo. Metaforicamente firmeza inabalável, necessidade e caráter inflexível. II. Diamante, pedra preciosa em Teofrasto, Platão e Plínio. III. Adjetival, inquebrável; poesia órfica. A identificação entre aço e diamante varia com época e contexto.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)da/mas&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1144&quot; key=&quot;a)da/mas&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδάμ-ας&quot;&gt;ἀδάμας&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;αντος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;δαμάω&lt;/etym&gt;):—first in &lt;author&gt;Hes.&lt;/author&gt; (in &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt; only as pr. n.), properly, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1144.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;unconquerable:&lt;/i&gt; &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;I&quot; id=&quot;n1144.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Subst.&lt;/pos&gt;, &lt;i&gt;adamant,&lt;/i&gt; i. e. the hardest metal, prob. &lt;i&gt;steel,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;χλωρός, πολιός,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0020,003:231&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hes.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sc.&lt;/title&gt; 231&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0020,001:161&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Th.&lt;/title&gt; 161&lt;/bibl&gt;: metaph., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδάμαντος ἔχον κρατερόφρονα θυμόν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0020,002:147&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Op.&lt;/title&gt; 147&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; of anything &lt;i&gt;fixed, unalterable,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἔπος ἐρέω ἀδάμαντι πελάσσας&lt;/foreign&gt; Orac. ap. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:7:141&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 7.141&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδάμαντος δῆσεν ἅλοις&lt;/foreign&gt; fixed them with nails &lt;i&gt;of adamant,&lt;/i&gt; i. e. inevitably, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:4:71&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 4.71&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:16:167&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;APl.&lt;/title&gt; 16.167&lt;/bibl&gt; (Antip. Sid.); &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὸν ἐν Ἅιδα κινήσαις ἀδάμαντα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0005,001:2:34&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Theoc.&lt;/author&gt; 2.34&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1144.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;diamond,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0093,004:19&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Thphr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lap.&lt;/title&gt; 19&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0525,001:8:18:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Paus.&lt;/author&gt; 8.18.6&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0071,001:56&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Peripl.M.Rubr.&lt;/title&gt; 56&lt;/bibl&gt;; prob. so meant in &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,031:59b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ti.&lt;/title&gt; 59b&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,008:303e&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Plt.&lt;/title&gt; 303e&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:phi,0978,001:37:55&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plin.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HN&lt;/title&gt; 37.55&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n1144.3&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; metaph., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὁ πόνος ἀδάμαντος,&lt;/foreign&gt; of love, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0402,001:245:13&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Alex.&lt;/author&gt; 245.13&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1144.4&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adj.&lt;/pos&gt;, &lt;i&gt;unbreakable,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀνακτίτης&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0579,003:192&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Orph.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;L.&lt;/title&gt; 192&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1145\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1145\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1159\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδαμαστί\" data-meanings=\"Advérbio: invencivelmente, sem ser dominado; Suda.\">ἀδαμαστί</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Advérbio: invencivelmente, sem ser dominado; Suda.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)damasti/&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1145&quot; key=&quot;a)damasti/&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδαμ-αστί&quot;&gt;ἀδαμαστί&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;sense id=&quot;n1145.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;unconquerably,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Suid.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1146\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1146\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1160\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδάμαστος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: não subjugado, indomável, inflexível; de Hades em Homero; de potro não adestrado em Xenofonte.\">ἀδάμαστος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: não subjugado, indomável, inflexível; de Hades em Homero; de potro não adestrado em Xenofonte.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)da/mastos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1146&quot; key=&quot;a)da/mastos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδάμ-αστος&quot;&gt;ἀδάμαστος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;δαμάω&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n1146.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;unsubdued, inflexible,&lt;/i&gt; of Hades, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:9:158&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 9.158&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;author&gt;Phld.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;D.&lt;/title&gt; 1.18: later in the proper sense, &lt;i&gt;untamed, unbroken,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πῶλος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,013:1:1&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Eq.&lt;/title&gt; 1.1&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0654,002:20&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Corn.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;ND&lt;/title&gt; 20&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. πᾶσιν&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Timo&lt;/author&gt; 9.1&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1147\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1147\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1161\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδάματος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: não vencido, indomado, selvagem; de jovem ainda não casada, virgem; de novilho; Ésquilo, Sófocles, Eurípides. Uso especialment\">ἀδάματος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: não vencido, indomado, selvagem; de jovem ainda não casada, virgem; de novilho; Ésquilo, Sófocles, Eurípides. Uso especialmente lírico na tragédia.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)da/ma^tos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1147&quot; key=&quot;a)da/ma^tos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδάμ-ᾰτος&quot;&gt;ἀδάματος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1147.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἀδάμαστος, &lt;i&gt;unconquered,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,006:54&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ch.&lt;/title&gt; 54&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,004:233&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Th.&lt;/title&gt; 233&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,004:205&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OT&lt;/title&gt; 205&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.: of females, &lt;i&gt;unwedded,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,003:450&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Aj.&lt;/title&gt; 450&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;i&gt;untamed,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μόσχος ἀ. πέσημα δίκε&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,015:640&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ph.&lt;/title&gt; 640&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.—Trag. word, always in lyr. (exc. &lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Aj.&lt;/title&gt; l.c.); restored by Elmsl. for &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδάμαντος&lt;/foreign&gt; or &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-αστος&lt;/foreign&gt; of codd. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1147a\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1147a\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1162\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδαμάτωρ\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: epíteto ritual de Hécate, ἀδαμάτωρ; Papiro Mágico de Paris 1.2717, sem etimologia segura na entrada.\">ἀδαμάτωρ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: epíteto ritual de Hécate, ἀδαμάτωρ; Papiro Mágico de Paris 1.2717, sem etimologia segura na entrada.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dama/twr&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1147a&quot; key=&quot;a)dama/twr&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδαμάτωρ&quot;&gt;ἀδαμάτωρ&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense&gt;epith. of Hecate, &lt;title&gt;PMag.Par.&lt;/title&gt; 1.2717.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1148\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1148\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1163\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδαμνεῖς\" data-meanings=\"Glosa ἀδαμνεῖς = ἀκολασταίνεις, «comportas-te licenciosamente, sem disciplina»; Hesíquio; variantes manuscritas.\">ἀδαμνεῖς</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Glosa ἀδαμνεῖς = ἀκολασταίνεις, «comportas-te licenciosamente, sem disciplina»; Hesíquio; variantes manuscritas.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)damnei=s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1148&quot; key=&quot;a)damnei=s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδαμ-νεῖς&quot;&gt;ἀδαμνεῖς&lt;/head&gt; (cod. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-αῖς&lt;/foreign&gt;): &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀκολασταίνεις&lt;/foreign&gt; (cod. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-αις&lt;/foreign&gt;), &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1149\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1149\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1164\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδαμνής\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ές e variante ἄδαμνος: equivalente a ἀδάμαστος, não dominado ou indomável; Hesíquio.\">ἀδαμνής</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ές e variante ἄδαμνος: equivalente a ἀδάμαστος, não dominado ou indomável; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)damnh/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1149&quot; key=&quot;a)damnh/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδαμ-νής&quot;&gt;ἀδαμνής&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ές&lt;/itype&gt;, and &lt;orth extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἄδαμ-νος&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1149.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἀδάμαστος, &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1150\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1150\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1165\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄδαμος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: equivalente a ἀδάμαστος, invencível ou indomado; poesia lírica jônica.\">ἄδαμος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: equivalente a ἀδάμαστος, invencível ou indomado; poesia lírica jônica.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/damos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1150&quot; key=&quot;a)/damos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄδαμ-ος&quot;&gt;ἄδαμος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1150.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἀδάμαστος, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0308,003:5&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ion Lyr.&lt;/author&gt; 9&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1151\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1151\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1166\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄδαν\" data-meanings=\"Forma eólica de ἄδην, «à saciedade, em abundância»; Álcman 76.\">ἄδαν</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Forma eólica de ἄδην, «à saciedade, em abundância»; Álcman 76.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/da_n&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1151&quot; key=&quot;a)/da_n&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄδᾱν&quot;&gt;ἄδαν&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Aeol.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; for &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄδην,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0291,001:76&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Alcm.&lt;/author&gt; 76&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1152\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1152\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1167\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδάνειστος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: não oferecido como garantia por outro empréstimo, livre de caução de dívida; papiro BGU 741.\">ἀδάνειστος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: não oferecido como garantia por outro empréstimo, livre de caução de dívida; papiro BGU 741.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)da/neistos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1152&quot; key=&quot;a)da/neistos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδάνειστος&quot;&gt;ἀδάνειστος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1152.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;not pledged as security,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄλλου δανείου&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,BGU:741&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;BGU&lt;/title&gt; 741&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; &lt;date&gt;(ii A.D.)&lt;/date&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1153\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1153\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1168\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδαξάω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo ἀδαξάω ou ἀδαξέω, com infinitivo ἀδαξῆσαι e forma ἀδάξομαι: remissão ao verbete ὀδάξω; não atribuir nova acepção sem cotejo.\">ἀδαξάω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo ἀδαξάω ou ἀδαξέω, com infinitivo ἀδαξῆσαι e forma ἀδάξομαι: remissão ao verbete ὀδάξω; não atribuir nova acepção sem cotejo.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)daca/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1153&quot; key=&quot;a)daca/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδαξάω&quot;&gt;ἀδαξάω&lt;/head&gt;, or &lt;orth extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀδαξ-έω&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδαξῆσαι, ἀδάξομαι,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; sub &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὀδάξω.&lt;/foreign&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1154\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1154\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1169\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδάπανος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον. I. Sem despesa, gratuito, que nada custa; Aristófanes, Díodoro. Advérbio ἀδαπάνως, sem gastos. II. De pessoas, que não gasta o\">ἀδάπανος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον. I. Sem despesa, gratuito, que nada custa; Aristófanes, Díodoro. Advérbio ἀδαπάνως, sem gastos. II. De pessoas, que não gasta ou não emprega dinheiro, com genitivo; Aristóteles; de comunidade isenta de encargos.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)da/pa^nos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1154&quot; key=&quot;a)da/pa^nos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδάπᾰνος&quot;&gt;ἀδάπανος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1154.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;without expense, costing nothing,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;γλυκέα κἀδάπανα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,005:593&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pax&lt;/title&gt; 593&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1699,002:7&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Teles&lt;/author&gt; p. 7.8 H.&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0060,001:10&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.S.&lt;/author&gt; 10&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 12. &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδαπάνως, τέρψαι φρένα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,016:1176&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Or.&lt;/title&gt; 1176&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;author&gt;Phld.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 2.133 &lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; (prob.). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1154.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; of persons, &lt;i&gt;not spending,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. χρημάτων εἰς τὸ δέον&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,045:1251b:7&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;VV&lt;/title&gt; 1251b7&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. καταστῆσαι τὸ κοινόν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;Michel&lt;/title&gt; 1007.33&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;placeName&gt;Teos&lt;/placeName&gt;), cf. &lt;title&gt;Inscr.Prien.&lt;/title&gt; 111.133 &lt;date&gt;(i B. C.)&lt;/date&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1155\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1155\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1170\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄδαπτον\" data-meanings=\"Glosa ἄδαπτον = γυμνόν, ἄδερμον, «nu, sem pele, despido»; Hesíquio.\">ἄδαπτον</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Glosa ἄδαπτον = γυμνόν, ἄδερμον, «nu, sem pele, despido»; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/dapton&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1155&quot; key=&quot;a)/dapton&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄδαπτον·&quot;&gt;ἄδαπτον&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;γυμνόν, ἄδερμον,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1156\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1156\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1171\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδάρκη\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino ἀδάρκη, também masculino ἀδάρκης e ἄδαρκος: eflorescência salina depositada sobre plantas de pântanos; Dioscórides, Gal\">ἀδάρκη</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino ἀδάρκη, também masculino ἀδάρκης e ἄδαρκος: eflorescência salina depositada sobre plantas de pântanos; Dioscórides, Galeno. Diminutivo ἀδάρκιον.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)da/rkh&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1156&quot; key=&quot;a)da/rkh&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδάρκη&quot;&gt;ἀδάρκη&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, or &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀδάρκης&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1156.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;salt efflorescence on the herbage of marshes,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Dsc.&lt;/author&gt; 5.119, &lt;author&gt;Damocr.&lt;/author&gt; ap. &lt;author&gt;Gal.&lt;/author&gt; 13.105: &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἄδαρκος&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Gal.&lt;/author&gt; 12.370; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;var&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Dim.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀδάρκιον&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, ibid.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1157\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1157\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1172\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄδαρτος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: sem ter a pele retirada, não esfolado; por extensão não espancado, não açoitado; Hesíquio, glossários.\">ἄδαρτος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: sem ter a pele retirada, não esfolado; por extensão não espancado, não açoitado; Hesíquio, glossários.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/dartos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1157&quot; key=&quot;a)/dartos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄδαρτος&quot;&gt;ἄδαρτος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;δέρω&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n1157.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;unflayed: not cudgelled,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;, &lt;title&gt;Gloss.&lt;/title&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1158\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1158\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1173\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄδασμος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: isento de tributo, livre de imposto; Ésquilo, fragmento 63.\">ἄδασμος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: isento de tributo, livre de imposto; Ésquilo, fragmento 63.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/dasmos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1158&quot; key=&quot;a)/dasmos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄδασμος&quot;&gt;ἄδασμος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1158.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;tribute-free,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,008:63&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 63&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1159\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1159\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1174\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄδαστος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: não dividido, não repartido ou distribuído; Sófocles, Ájax 54; variante ἄδατος em Hesíquio.\">ἄδαστος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: não dividido, não repartido ou distribuído; Sófocles, Ájax 54; variante ἄδατος em Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/dastos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1159&quot; key=&quot;a)/dastos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄδαστος&quot;&gt;ἄδαστος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;δάσασθαι&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n1159.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;undivided,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,003:54&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Aj.&lt;/title&gt; 54&lt;/bibl&gt;; also &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἄδατος&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1160\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1160\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1175\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀδαυῶς\" data-meanings=\"Advérbio ἀδαυῶς = ἐγρηγόρως, «em vigília, estando desperto»; Hesíquio.\">ἀδαυῶς</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Advérbio ἀδαυῶς = ἐγρηγόρως, «em vigília, estando desperto»; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)dauw=s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1160&quot; key=&quot;a)dauw=s&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀδαυῶς·&quot;&gt;ἀδαυῶς&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐγρηγόρως,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>";
